Scratch Film demo · 《夜里往上游》 The Night Climb · third-party assets and sources

## Voice
- Kokoro-82M v1.0 (hexgrad), voice bf_emma, Apache License 2.0; run locally via kokoro-onnx (MIT) through the
  library's core/tts/tts.py. Speech check: faster-whisper base.en (MIT; OpenAI Whisper weights, MIT).
  Script: demo/vo/lines.json.

## Music samples (CC0; credit not required, given with thanks)
- Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios): vibraphone, vibraphone (bowed), vibraphone (hard mallets),
  snare (snares off).
- VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios): glockenspiel, log drum, double bass (pizzicato and arco).
  (core/audio/sampler.py). The needle sounds, the sea, the whooshes and the drawn tones are synthesised in demo/mix.py
  with core/audio/sfx.py.

